LUMA SUMMARY:
Q-Tip/browser-independence architecture session. Cozmo insists the user should not have to do non-normal browser/debug setup; QuackSink should be a guest that adapts itself to the host environment. The team explores an internal/controlled browser layer and a free Playwright extension bridge, with extension testing identified as the next concrete step.
